      CONFIG_MESSAGE:  <set to the key 'missing' of config map 'app-config'>  Optional: false
```
I need to change `<set to the key 'missing' of config map 'app-config'>` to `<set to the key 'message' of config map 'app-config'>`.

I will construct a strategic merge patch for the environment variable.

The patch will look something like this, focusing on updating the `CONFIG_MESSAGE` environment variable:
```json
{
  "spec": {
    "template": {
      "spec": {
        "containers": [
          {
            "name": "app",
            "env": [
